 "description": "<p>Christmas red meets the cheongsam cut: a polyester dress with rabbit ears and sleeves included, in an oriental silhouette that stands out in a December closet full of elf costumes. M fits 40-55 kg, L fits 55-65 kg.</p>\n<p>The rabbit ears are the crossover detail - they nod to the holiday without a single snowflake print. The cheongsam collar and side closure do the rest, and the sleeves balance the short hemline with a little formal structure.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: cheongsam, rabbit ears, sleeves</li>\n<li>Style: oriental, Christmas red</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-55 kg), L (55-65 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick by weight. This is the holiday-party answer for anyone tired of red-white fur trim.</p>\n",
